# Get these from https://bridge.setu.co/v2/signup -> register an FIU ->
# create an "Account Aggregator" product -> Step 2 "Test product" -> click
# "+ Add new" under Testing details to generate a product-specific
# client_id/secret pair (the org-wide Settings > API keys pair is NOT
# auto-attached to a product and will 401). Product instance ID comes from
# that same Step 2 panel's "Use your product ID ... as x-product-instance-id"
# line -- not the Product ID shown on the product's own overview page.
#
# SETU_BASE_URL for sandbox is confirmed: https://fiu-sandbox.setu.co
# Auth is a real client-credentials exchange (POST /v1/users/login on a
# DIFFERENT host, orgservice-prod.setu.co, returns a short-lived bearer
# JWT), not direct client-id/secret headers on every call -- see
# client.py's docstring. Verified end-to-end (real HTTP 201 consent
# creation) on 2026-08-02.
SETU_BASE_URL=https://fiu-sandbox.setu.co
SETU_CLIENT_ID=
SETU_PRODUCT_INSTANCE_ID=
SETU_CLIENT_SECRET=
